-- Transfer-route translations for all 72 real Maldives transfer routes
-- into all 6 rolled-out languages (de/es/it/ru/ja/zh), powering the new
-- /{locale}/maldives/transfers/[route]/ route. Every one of the 72 live
-- routes has the identical English title "{Origin} to {Destination}"
-- and summary "Transfer route from {Origin} to {Destination}." (no
-- free-form per-route text to translate), so title/summary/slug are
-- built from one fixed sentence template per locale rather than
-- per-route content -- origin/destination names are proper nouns and
-- stay untranslated, same convention as packages. short_description
-- and description both equal the translated summary, mirroring
-- TransferRouteDetail.summary being the single underlying field.
-- body_html is unused for transfer routes (kept empty). Already applied
-- directly against the live DB; this migration keeps a from-scratch
-- replay in sync.
on conflict (entity_id, locale) do update set
  slug = excluded.slug, title = excluded.title, short_description = excluded.short_description, description = excluded.description,
  body_html = excluded.body_html, meta_title = excluded.meta_title, meta_description = excluded.meta_description,
  translation_status = excluded.translation_status, translated_by = excluded.translated_by, updated_at = now();
